        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elwood%2C_Kansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Elwood takes its name from pioneer John B., a key figure in the area’s early settlement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://dpcountyks.com/city/elwood/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Elwood hosted the first Kansas station of the historic Pony Express, linking the frontier to the east.",
